    "text": "Rule A-009 (docs/assumptions/A-009-weekly-trade-rule.md), held with no rebalance (each entry keeps its shares for 13\nweeks): each Friday, the 3 tickers with the highest rank of the automatic model P50 / price inside their FF12 sector,\nnot held, at most one for each sector, each in the top fifth of its sector; 1/39 of the value each; exit after 13\nweeks. It has a higher annual return than the equal-weight line of the same list after 10 bp on each traded value.\nThe share counts are on the price basis (split table store 58e54a2). Decision rule (PLANNING/board/\nT-20261121-split-basis-fix.md, rerun test, item 4): a mean yearly excess above 0, a raw t of 2.0 or more, above 0 in at\nleast 7 of 9 years, and T2 to T4 of the blind projection test pass on corrected prices. The design sample 2018-2026 was\nused before (with the split defect), so this run describes; it does not confirm.\n",
